WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:01.968
-Guys, today is Friday,

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:02.701
and that's usually
when I catch up

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:03.767
on some personal stuff.

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:05.567
I check my inbox
and return some emails

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:07.100
and, of course,
I send out thank you notes.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.334
I was running behind --

00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:10.267
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:12.267
Can I write out some thank you
notes right now? Is that okay?

00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:13.767
[ Cheering and applause ]
Thank you.

00:00:13.767 --> 00:00:16.067
James, can I get some thank you
note-writing music, please?

00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:17.701
[ Playing tender tune ]
Ooh.

00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:18.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.434 --> 00:00:19.501
-It's George Santos.

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:20.534
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, my gosh.

00:00:20.534 --> 00:00:22.634
♪♪

00:00:22.634 --> 00:00:23.968
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:25.701
-I don't know how he does it.
-Yeah.

00:00:25.701 --> 00:00:26.501
Every week.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.767
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.767 --> 00:00:32.434
-Thank you,
Instagram quiet mode,

00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:33.734
for letting me focus
on the things

00:00:33.734 --> 00:00:35.100
that really matter in life --

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:35.801
TikToks.

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:38.868
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.100
-[ Clucking ]

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.567
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.567 --> 00:00:45.734
Thank you, Canada,
for changing

00:00:45.734 --> 00:00:47.767
your recommendations
on alcohol consumption

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:50.467
from two drinks a day
to two drinks a week.

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:51.634
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.634 --> 00:00:53.167
And, for Canadians
who can't handle that,

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:55.701
maybe it's time to look into AA,
eh eh?

00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:58.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:58.234 --> 00:01:00.133
[ Cheering ]

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:03.834
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.834 --> 00:01:08.000
Thank you, news of a "Megan"
sequel in 2025.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Of course, Meghan will be
a teenager by then,

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.567
so, instead of murdering people,

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:12.901
she'll just make cruel remarks

00:01:12.901 --> 00:01:14.367
that destroy
their self-esteem.

00:01:14.367 --> 00:01:17.300
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:01:18.734 --> 00:01:19.400
-Wow.

00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:22.701
"You smell."

00:01:22.701 --> 00:01:23.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:24.801
"You're going
to wear that shirt?"

00:01:24.801 --> 00:01:27.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.534 --> 00:01:28.534
-"Again?"

00:01:28.534 --> 00:01:30.367
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.367 --> 00:01:31.667
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:34.067
Thank you,
news that men who use Viagra

00:01:34.067 --> 00:01:35.968
are likely to live longer.

00:01:35.968 --> 00:01:37.100
Or, as guys put it,

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:38.400
[ Haltingly ]
"Finally, a reason for me

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.234
to begin taking Viagra."

00:01:40.234 --> 00:01:43.133
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.367
How do you do it?
-Yeah. Oh.

00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:48.334
It's blue!

00:01:48.334 --> 00:01:51.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:55.634
-That's what he says
after he takes it?

00:01:55.634 --> 00:01:56.634
-Yeah.
-[ As Jerry Lewis ] Whoa!

00:01:56.634 --> 00:01:57.968
-[ As Lewis ] Whoa!
-Whoa, boy!

00:01:58.033 --> 00:01:59.667
-Hello! [ Pops cheek ]
-Whoa, boy!

00:01:59.667 --> 00:02:00.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:02.234
Ring the bell.
-Hoo, boy.

00:02:02.234 --> 00:02:03.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.901 --> 00:02:05.334
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:08.033
Thank you, dry January,

00:02:08.033 --> 00:02:10.067
for being followed up
with Forget It February

00:02:10.067 --> 00:02:11.167
and Marchgarita.

00:02:11.167 --> 00:02:12.868
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:12.868 --> 00:02:14.467
Marchgarita.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:16.000
Boing!

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:16.901
Oh, boy!

00:02:16.901 --> 00:02:19.167
-Hoh-hoy, it's blue!

00:02:19.167 --> 00:02:20.601
-Egg smuggler.

00:02:20.601 --> 00:02:22.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.634 --> 00:02:23.634
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.634 --> 00:02:25.534
Thank you, January,

00:02:25.534 --> 00:02:28.167
for being God's chance
to put the weather on shuffle.

00:02:28.167 --> 00:02:31.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:31.167 --> 00:02:32.200
[ Cheering ]

00:02:35.601 --> 00:02:36.400
-Aww.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.467 --> 00:02:37.534
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.534 --> 00:02:39.400
-Thank you, Tom Brady,

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.467
for making me feel better

00:02:40.467 --> 00:02:42.868
about not having
any plans this weekend.

00:02:42.868 --> 00:02:44.734
[ Cheering and applause ]
There you have it.
Those are my Thank You Notes.

00:02:44.734 --> 00:02:48.467
We'll be right back
with Colin Jost! Come on.

